  "description": "Capsule.Metadata encodes strongly-typed key-value metadata records into the Oakrey Capsule binary framing protocol (capsule ID 0xFFFF). Each record carries a key, a DataType (String, Boolean, Byte, Short, Long, Int, Float, Double), an optional Unit, and a typed value. Up to 255 records can be batched in a single MetaCapsule. Suitable for IoT, telemetry, and data-logging scenarios.",
